026-06-23T12:02:18Z"},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Closes #63550\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nThere were a number of issues in the functionality to convert the old ArrayMesh format to the new one:\r\n* The Tangent array data was accidentally written to the Normal array data as a result of an accidental use of the `ARRAY_NORMAL` offset\r\n  * As a result of this, the mesh was loaded with garbage normals and garbage tangents\r\n* Compressed normals and tangents weren't being properly decompressed before attempting to encode them\r\n   * when compressing normals and tangents without octahedral compression, they were multiplied by 127 and stored as an uint8_t ([see the old code](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/ed879eb87b1d4cd8c100815f7061bf93511b6611/servers/visual_server.cpp#L534)); however, we were not dividing them by 127 when reading them.\r\n* The old value of `ARRAY_FLAG_USE_2D_VERTICES` was set on the new ArrayMesh `format` instead of the new one","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godo